# The context is the repository root; the Dockerfile only COPYs app/pyproject.toml,
# app/uv.lock and app/app/. Patterns are **-prefixed because the sources live under app/.

# ~190 MB and 9,000+ files, all of it shipped to the daemon on every build.
**/.venv

**/.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# The venv is byte-compiled at build time by UV_COMPILE_BYTECODE instead.
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

**/tests/
**/scripts/
**/*.md

.env
**/.env.*

Makefile
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
k8s/
.github/
*.log
